  ('e1f745d0-0def-438d-b471-c60ffdcdbfa9', 'C', 'process_step_confusion', $a$Drops the ionic-charge constraint entirely and counts electrons for the neutral atom (21 - 0 = 21), the configuration of neutral scandium$a$),
